9599e5137d255cc0159ba34fe9045ef57a62\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://hunyuan-prod-1258344703.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/multimedia/1c31be76d984d6f95a69b961cd7f7fdd/20260831160954url_tier_chart.png?q-sign-algorithm=sha1&amp;q-ak=AKID0qSq0xJRL7h3A4nIYJFrFOJ1VlnbIm26&amp;q-sign-time=1788163794%3B1819699794&amp;q-key-time=1788163794%3B1819699794&amp;q-header-list=host&amp;q-url-param-list=&amp;q-signature=949043479fdb6c060abf4e55f76e8db2c6b48d1d\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://hunyuan-prod-1258344703.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/multimedia/1c31be76d984d6f95a69b961cd7f7fdd/20260831160954url_tier_chart.png?q-sign-algorithm=sha1&amp;q-ak=AKID0qSq0xJRL7h3A4nIYJFrFOJ1VlnbIm26&amp;q-sign-time=1788163794%3B1819699794&amp;q-key-time=1788163794%3B1819699794&amp;q-header-list=host&amp;q-url-param-list=&amp;q-signature=949043479fdb6c060abf4e55f76e8db2c6b48d1d\"/></p>\n","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1238446","replies":53,"created_ts":1788166816,"title":"mac 本地部署 llm 不是最佳选择","author":"Need4more","author_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/u/Need4more","author_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/19ce/f31a/305835_mini.png?m=1788164101"},{"id":1238291,"node":"职场话题","node_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/go/career","node_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_mini.png?m=1768280127","description":"最近大礼包的同学比较多，诗和远方在房贷面前都变成了求职面试，想做个 AI 面试工具，先调研下。<br /><br />想法：面试录音/或单独上传面试信息-&gt;ai 面试记录整理分析报告-&gt;提取每次的要点成卡片方便快速复习。<br /><br />目标：贩卖 ai 的整理归纳能力，做面试相关的业务。<br /><br />想听真话：<br />1. 想问问大家会使用么？<br />2. 要是使用的话大家还想要哪些功能？<br /><br />喷就喷，别客气。","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1238291","replies":49,"created_ts":1788141418,"title":"面试录个音不犯规吧？大家帮忙投个票","author":"litianyunq","author_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/u/litianyunq","author_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9e51/5f8c/533933_mini.png?m=1788140919"},{"id":1238355,"node":"程序员","node_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/go/programmer","node_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_mini.png?m=1733731195","description":"<p>大家一年的 token 费用大概预估在多少钱？\n以后大家能接受一年多少支出在 ai 上 ？</p>\n","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1238355","replies":48,"created_ts":1788148704,"title":"大家一年的 token 费用大概预估在多少钱？\r\n以后大家能接受一年多少支出在 ai 上","author":"clemente","author_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/u/clemente","author_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9a6c/b769/455659_mini.png?m=1782533936"},{"id":1238315,"node":"优惠信息","node_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/go/deals","node_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/8d31/7bdc/747_mini.png?m=1523201604","description":"<p>最近体验了孙割搞的那个中转站，注册就能白嫖几款国产模型，连绑卡都省了，响应速度也还过得去。就是用的担惊受怕的：这波算不算是先赔本赚吆喝？免费背后有没有啥隐藏风险？还是说这次真让我反向薅到孙哥的羊毛了？\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/F02bjOe.png\"/> </p>\n<p>备注：1.孙割 = 孙宇晨 2 中转站地址就不发了 网上随便就能搜到</p>\n","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1238315","replies":46,"created_ts":1788143724,"title":"孙割的羊毛可以薅吗？","author":"IlIl","author_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/u/IlIl","author_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d3203a0d2df4bdc5381a2e4e62c510ff?s=24&d=retro"},{"id":1238382,"node":"随想","node_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/go/random","node_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/093f/65e0/59_mini.png?m=1747623725","description":"<p>我个人的一个小观点，抛砖引玉</p>\n<p>我判断未来一人公司、小型创业或者小型工作室会得到莫大发展，而现在 API 又太贵，我现在一个月要用 2000 刀以上，如果没有公司付款我用不起，如何解决？我认为一定是本地部署+开源模型</p>\n<p>我特别看好 AI 短剧这个赛道，但大家如果用过 AI 生成视频一定知道，现在生成视频太贵了，太慢，这个对于短剧来说影响很大，一部好剧必须精致+速度，如果质量差没人看，更新太慢热度过了</p>\n<p>想象一下，在未来，个人、小型创业公司、工作室，如果买一台 mac studio ，或者 mac mini 集群，可以本地部署顶级开源模型，0 维护成本，几乎无限使用，会是一个什么样的场景</p>\n<p>顶级的开源模型未来仍然需要付费，但不是通过 API 的方式，我认为极有可能是许可证，比如一款新型的、定制的 license</p>\n<p>对于苹果来说，他们可能刚刚认识到 mac mini 、mac studio 这类产品真正的价值，比如最近的新闻 openai 、Amzon 这类的公司已经大量采购 mac mini 、studio</p>\n","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1238382","replies":46,"created_ts":1788155793,"title":"我认为苹果是 AI 时代最大赢家，核心在 Mac","author":"CaptainD","author_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/u/CaptainD","author_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5a58/f882/515015_mini.png?m=1715830920"},{"id":1238326,"node":"OpenAI","node_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/go/openai","node_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_mini.png?m=1751736785","description":"<p>按照这个节奏应该买个 5X 就完全够了！</p>\n","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1238326","replies":44,"created_ts":1788144697,"title":"tibo 真是疯了， codex 刚刚又重置了感觉 pro20x 这个月白买了","author":"hefmt137","author_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/u/hefmt137","author_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e79b187e76b321a733265197a7e45360?s=24&d=retro"}]